    },
    "保存预算": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save Budget"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置后，记账页会按「(月预算 − 已花) ÷ 剩余天数」实时显示今日可花额度，超速消费当天就能看到，而不是月底才发现超支。设为 0 关闭预算。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once set, the entry page shows today's allowance as (budget − spent) ÷ days left, so you notice overspending the same day, not at month end. Set 0 to disable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对账": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconcile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对一下每个账户的真实余额，有差额点「补平」，系统会自动记一笔调整，让账永远是平的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compare each account's real balance with the book balance. Tap to record the difference automatically so your books always balance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账面余额": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Book Balance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "实际余额": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actual Balance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "差额": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Difference"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "补平：记一笔漏记支出": {
      "localizations": {
